# FindMySpace Supabase deployment

- Cursor Supabase MCP stays **read-only**. Never execute production DDL/DML through MCP.
- Schema changes must exist first as numbered files in `supabase/migrations/`.
- Next migration after `062` is `063`. Never reuse a number. Never rename existing migrations.
- Never run raw `supabase db push` or `supabase migration repair`.
- Deploy only with guarded repo scripts: `npm run db:guard`, then `npm run apply:migration -- NNN`.
- Expected project ref is **`ppdaubmxrmzgmxdnyxff`**. Abort on any other target.
- Never print access tokens, passwords, service-role keys, or anon keys.
